WEBVTT

00:00:02.200 --> 00:00:07.280
I can't finish reading the magazine pages

00:00:09.200 --> 00:00:14.190
I get the feeling that I must read it

00:00:16.080 --> 00:00:20.940
Game cartridges are stacked in the corner of the room

00:00:22.880 --> 00:00:27.640
Is there no meaning if I don't play them?

00:00:29.860 --> 00:00:32.730
You're on the other side of the table

00:00:33.190 --> 00:00:36.100
I'm talking to you, but...

00:00:36.700 --> 00:00:43.040
You don't change your facial expression at all

00:00:43.970 --> 00:00:49.280
Even though I'm this close to you

00:00:49.780 --> 00:00:56.550
These feelings don't reach you, don't reach you

00:00:56.990 --> 00:01:03.300
What is truly precious?

00:01:07.260 --> 00:01:11.160
Toon Summoned Skull, attack Dark Magician!

00:01:18.800 --> 00:01:22.430
The trap card Mirror Force.

00:01:28.300 --> 00:01:30.240
No!

00:01:30.360 --> 00:01:31.500
We did it!

00:01:31.500 --> 00:01:33.240
All the Toons are destroyed!

00:01:33.240 --> 00:01:36.900
Yes.  It was your courage that destroyed the Toons.

00:01:37.180 --> 00:01:42.200
No wonder you deserve to possess a Millennium Item.

00:01:42.200 --> 00:01:45.250
I can't play around anymore.

00:01:45.460 --> 00:01:52.040
Yugi boy, it will now be a battle between those chosen by the Millennium Items.

00:01:52.650 --> 00:01:55.690
We will decide this in a Shadow Game!

00:01:55.900 --> 00:01:57.200
A Shadow Game?

00:01:58.500 --> 00:02:04.500
Evil Eye Activates
Relinquished

00:02:15.950 --> 00:02:17.880
Bakura, you...

00:02:19.820 --> 00:02:22.680
I'm not the Bakura you know.

00:02:22.880 --> 00:02:27.360
I'm a soul that dwells inside the Millennium Ring, which is one of the Millennium Items.

00:02:32.320 --> 00:02:33.540
Millennium Ring?

00:02:33.540 --> 00:02:36.540
Mokuba hid a key, and I want it.

00:02:36.540 --> 00:02:41.420
It opens the vault containing Kaiba Corporation's important documents.

00:02:42.240 --> 00:02:46.780
If you hand Mokuba over, I'll let you leave.

00:02:47.330 --> 00:02:50.310
It's pointless to say anything to Bakura right now.

00:02:50.310 --> 00:02:53.280
He's being controlled by that Millennium Ring.

00:02:56.340 --> 00:02:58.310
Fine.

00:02:58.310 --> 00:03:01.200
You can have this twerp.

00:03:03.290 --> 00:03:05.030
Take him!

00:03:12.220 --> 00:03:13.860
Forgive me, Bakura.

00:03:20.930 --> 00:03:22.660
It's this thing's fault.

00:03:35.300 --> 00:03:39.060
The Shadow Game begins.

00:03:43.600 --> 00:03:46.600
Shadows are surrounding us.

00:03:51.140 --> 00:03:53.140
Shadow Game?

00:03:53.140 --> 00:03:55.110
What's starting?

00:03:59.110 --> 00:04:00.480
Hey!

00:04:01.600 --> 00:04:04.050
Honda!  Those two are...

00:04:04.800 --> 00:04:07.500
I rescued Mokuba from prison.

00:04:09.000 --> 00:04:10.970
What happened to Bakura?

00:04:11.180 --> 00:04:12.160
He's okay.

00:04:12.160 --> 00:04:13.720
He just passed out.

00:04:14.980 --> 00:04:16.570
It's happening here too?

00:04:16.800 --> 00:04:17.880
Here too?

00:04:17.880 --> 00:04:20.780
It's hard for me to believe, but...

00:04:21.020 --> 00:04:22.680
What happened?

00:04:22.680 --> 00:04:23.740
Tell us.

00:04:24.260 --> 00:04:25.710
A Shadow Game.

00:04:29.440 --> 00:04:31.950
We can't see anything from here.

00:04:31.950 --> 00:04:33.550
Let's go downstairs.

00:04:34.140 --> 00:04:37.910
Unfortunately, we have to leave them here.

00:04:37.910 --> 00:04:38.710
Yeah.

00:04:49.150 --> 00:04:50.970
What is that?

00:04:50.970 --> 00:04:52.350
Yugi...

00:04:58.840 --> 00:05:00.570
A Shadow Game?

00:05:01.420 --> 00:05:07.220
The mind of a normal person will not be able to survive this upcoming battle, Yugi boy.

00:05:07.440 --> 00:05:11.800
The strength of the other mind will be tested.

00:05:13.200 --> 00:05:16.710
My other self can't survive a Shadow Game.

00:05:22.440 --> 00:05:26.570
My other self, I will draw from now on.

00:05:29.320 --> 00:05:36.170
But if we don't duel together, Pegasus's Millennium Eye will know our strategies.

00:05:36.170 --> 00:05:39.370
I'll be fine, so let me battle too.

00:05:39.860 --> 00:05:40.850
Fine.

00:05:47.240 --> 00:05:48.930
It's my turn.

00:05:49.160 --> 00:05:52.560
Dark-Eyes Illusionist in attack position.

00:06:00.880 --> 00:06:02.310
What is that?

00:06:02.640 --> 00:06:10.750
Though Kaiba Corporation's Duel Ring is the height of technology, it's useless in a Shadow Game.

00:06:11.330 --> 00:06:16.620
The player's emotional strength makes the monsters materialize.

00:06:17.220 --> 00:06:23.590
So if you lose your emotional strength, I can't vouch for your life.

00:06:23.590 --> 00:06:29.820
Dark-Eyes Illusionist is an illusion monster with 0 attack and defense points.

00:06:29.820 --> 00:06:32.070
I can't attack it carelessly.

00:06:32.460 --> 00:06:35.800
I'm sure it has special abilities.

00:06:38.010 --> 00:06:40.880
I play Curse of Dragon.

00:06:41.800 --> 00:06:43.510
I end my turn!

00:06:51.520 --> 00:06:55.140
Think about your strategies while I'm in control.

00:06:57.680 --> 00:06:59.580
Mind Shuffle.

00:06:59.580 --> 00:07:03.820
They changed minds again to stop me from reading them.

00:07:03.820 --> 00:07:04.870
However...

00:07:05.260 --> 00:07:11.580
The other Yugi boy doesn't have the emotional strength to survive this battle.

00:07:12.880 --> 00:07:14.530
What's going on?

00:07:14.530 --> 00:07:16.810
My chest hurts.

00:07:20.940 --> 00:07:28.360
The real monster is rapidly eroding my other self's emotional strength.

00:07:31.240 --> 00:07:34.000
Hang in there, my other self.

00:07:34.220 --> 00:07:38.400
As I suspected, the other Yugi is a mere human.

00:07:38.400 --> 00:07:40.820
He will run out of strength soon.

00:07:49.100 --> 00:07:50.800
What's wrong, Anzu?

00:07:50.910 --> 00:07:56.680
I feel that Yugi is suffering inside those shadows.

00:07:56.680 --> 00:07:58.300
You're not wrong.

00:07:58.300 --> 00:08:00.960
I have a heavy feeling in my heart.

00:08:01.950 --> 00:08:02.930
Me too.

00:08:03.900 --> 00:08:05.350
You too, Honda?

00:08:05.350 --> 00:08:11.150
I saw Bakura use the power of the shadows to make a monster materialize from his card.

00:08:11.150 --> 00:08:12.400
No way!

00:08:12.750 --> 00:08:17.470
The power of the shadows is more powerful than we can imagine.

00:08:20.740 --> 00:08:27.180
I set one card and end my turn.

00:08:33.300 --> 00:08:36.560
My other self's emotional strength is limited.

00:08:36.880 --> 00:08:40.030
I can't let this battle last for too long!

00:08:42.700 --> 00:08:45.930
Curse of Dragon attacks on my turn!

00:08:52.400 --> 00:08:53.980
You fell for it.

00:08:53.980 --> 00:08:57.740
You're speeding up this match in order to protect the other Yugi.

00:08:57.740 --> 00:08:59.650
That was my goal.

00:09:00.820 --> 00:09:04.520
Dark-Eyes Illusionist's effect activates!

00:09:06.910 --> 00:09:08.790
Dark-Eyes Magic!

00:09:10.620 --> 00:09:11.560
What?

00:09:11.850 --> 00:09:18.030
Illusion monsters have low attack and defense points, but they make up for it with effects.

00:09:18.550 --> 00:09:25.010
Dark-Eyes Illusionist uses the magic of its evil eye to steal its opponent's abilities.

00:09:25.220 --> 00:09:29.480
But the true horror of illusion monsters is only getting started!

00:09:29.700 --> 00:09:30.680
What?

00:09:32.150 --> 00:09:34.140
Black Illusion Ritual.

00:09:34.140 --> 00:09:39.240
I tribute Dark-Eyes Illusionist to this card.

00:09:55.540 --> 00:09:59.060
I summon the illusion monster Relinquished!

00:10:12.020 --> 00:10:15.620
The Ritual Monster Relinquished?

00:10:15.860 --> 00:10:19.130
Relinquished's effect activates!

00:10:29.870 --> 00:10:32.570
What?  My Curse of Dragon!

00:10:35.400 --> 00:10:37.510
I end my turn.

00:10:38.460 --> 00:10:41.700
Dark Magician, attack Relinquished!

00:10:44.330 --> 00:10:46.150
Sacrifice Shield!

00:10:49.120 --> 00:10:50.240
What?

00:10:50.240 --> 00:10:53.830
It absorbed Curse of Dragon and is using it as a shield!

00:10:54.880 --> 00:10:58.800
Dark Magician's attack destroys Curse of Dragon!

00:10:59.300 --> 00:11:02.840
I lose life points due to friendly fire.

00:11:02.840 --> 00:11:10.740
Relinquished can absorb your monsters to gain their attack and defense points.

00:11:10.930 --> 00:11:17.100
And you will lose life points if you attack Relinquished.

00:11:18.520 --> 00:11:21.960
Relinquished is an incredible monster!

00:11:52.290 --> 00:11:53.990
My turn.

00:11:54.460 --> 00:11:59.460
I activate Relinquished's effect Dark-Eyes Magic!

00:12:06.520 --> 00:12:10.680
Dark Magician is caught in the evil eye's curse.

00:12:13.310 --> 00:12:15.510
Relinquished will absorb it!

00:12:23.170 --> 00:12:24.420
Dark Magician!

00:12:33.600 --> 00:12:36.030
It's using Dark Magician as a shield.

00:12:37.500 --> 00:12:42.880
Relinquished has absorbed Dark Magician's attack and defense points.

00:12:42.880 --> 00:12:45.730
If you attack it, you will lose life points.

00:12:45.730 --> 00:12:47.940
What will you do, Yugi boy?

00:12:50.410 --> 00:12:53.880
This is my invincible illusion combo.

00:12:54.140 --> 00:12:57.530
How can I destroy Relinquished?

00:12:57.530 --> 00:12:59.850
There's no way I can right now.

00:13:00.460 --> 00:13:02.340
You can't give up!

00:13:02.860 --> 00:13:06.830
Even now, Pegasus is trying to read your mind.

00:13:07.200 --> 00:13:11.300
I'll stall for time, so think of a strategy.

00:13:11.600 --> 00:13:14.300
Your emotional strength is at its limit.

00:13:14.300 --> 00:13:16.080
You shouldn't do anything anymore!

00:13:16.080 --> 00:13:20.270
No, let me battle until the end.

00:13:20.840 --> 00:13:26.250
But if you reach your limit, your soul will be lost for eternity.

00:13:30.680 --> 00:13:33.190
Yugi, you...

00:13:40.130 --> 00:13:41.530
It's my turn.

00:13:44.000 --> 00:13:47.000
Your mind is vanishing.

00:13:49.960 --> 00:13:56.640
Please let this last card I draw be something that can defeat Pegasus.

00:14:00.900 --> 00:14:01.880
Please!

00:14:09.820 --> 00:14:13.040
I set one card.

00:14:16.400 --> 00:14:18.730
I play Feral Imp in defense position.

00:14:21.700 --> 00:14:27.640
My other self, use this card to defeat Pegasus.

00:14:28.580 --> 00:14:33.650
The other mind is as good as buried.

00:14:35.080 --> 00:14:37.120
Relinquished attacks.

00:14:41.060 --> 00:14:43.580
Illusion Black Magic!

00:14:50.180 --> 00:14:52.800
Hang in there, my other self!

00:14:56.720 --> 00:14:59.440
You must defeat Pegasus.

00:14:59.440 --> 00:15:02.140
Goodbye, the other Yugi boy.

00:15:10.320 --> 00:15:11.730
What?

00:15:12.060 --> 00:15:15.130
I just had a very terrible feeling.

00:15:15.130 --> 00:15:16.690
Yeah.  Same here.

00:15:16.900 --> 00:15:19.460
Did something happen to Yugi?

00:15:19.810 --> 00:15:21.160
Oh no...

00:15:30.060 --> 00:15:31.530
Hang in there!

00:15:31.530 --> 00:15:33.400
Pull yourself together!

00:15:33.400 --> 00:15:37.310
Please wake up, my other self!

00:15:37.540 --> 00:15:40.310
Please pull yourself together!

00:15:41.060 --> 00:15:48.760
Yugi boy's other mind didn't reach the level of playing a Shadow Game.

00:15:48.970 --> 00:15:52.730
I defeated that other mind.

00:15:53.930 --> 00:15:55.360
Yugi...

00:15:55.580 --> 00:16:01.830
If what we're imagining is happening inside that shadow field...

00:16:02.140 --> 00:16:04.800
Is there nothing we can do?

00:16:04.800 --> 00:16:07.600
We can only stand here and do nothing?

00:16:08.440 --> 00:16:09.900
Yugi!

00:16:10.130 --> 00:16:10.940
Anzu!

00:16:11.330 --> 00:16:12.800
Anzu?

00:16:13.260 --> 00:16:14.650
What happened?

00:16:19.160 --> 00:16:20.720
What's going on?

00:16:20.720 --> 00:16:22.960
All right, I'll go next.

00:16:23.060 --> 00:16:24.660
Out of my way, Anzu!

00:16:30.220 --> 00:16:31.920
Hey, Honda!

00:16:31.920 --> 00:16:33.730
Honda, are you okay?

00:16:33.960 --> 00:16:36.260
Damn!  What's going on?

00:16:37.760 --> 00:16:38.780
Honda?

00:16:38.780 --> 00:16:39.710
No good.

00:16:39.930 --> 00:16:42.170
I ended up on the other side.

00:16:42.800 --> 00:16:46.880
It's impossible for us to enter a Shadow Game.

00:16:46.880 --> 00:16:52.890
We can't help our friend when he's in great danger?

00:16:54.320 --> 00:16:58.320
If only we could share our hearts with him.

00:17:09.180 --> 00:17:14.770
Pegasus, I will never forgive you!

00:17:16.120 --> 00:17:28.330
But Yugi boy, since you lost your other mind, you can't Mind Shuffle to oppose my Millennium Eye.

00:17:28.330 --> 00:17:31.820
Do you still intend to continue this duel?

00:17:31.820 --> 00:17:33.060
Of course!

00:17:33.380 --> 00:17:37.730
There's no game over until you break my spirit!

00:17:37.930 --> 00:17:39.380
Continue the game.

00:17:39.380 --> 00:17:41.700
It's your turn, Yugi boy.

00:17:44.870 --> 00:17:46.600
Mind Scan!

00:17:49.160 --> 00:17:52.380
You drew Winged Dragon, Guardian of the Fortress #1.

00:17:52.700 --> 00:17:56.580
A Normal Monster with 1400 attack points.

00:17:56.800 --> 00:18:00.400
Pegasus knows all the cards in my hand.

00:18:01.020 --> 00:18:06.300
The only card he doesn't know is the set card that Yugi left behind.

00:18:07.790 --> 00:18:09.760
I must risk it all on this card.

00:18:09.760 --> 00:18:13.360
I play Winged Dragon, Guardian of the Fortress #1 in defense position.

00:18:18.540 --> 00:18:20.120
I end my turn.

00:18:20.400 --> 00:18:22.420
Then it's my turn.

00:18:22.420 --> 00:18:25.910
Relinquished, Illusion Black Magic!

00:18:29.660 --> 00:18:32.650
Winged Dragon, Guardian of the Fortress #1 is destroyed.

00:18:32.920 --> 00:18:35.490
I also play Jigen Bakudan!

00:18:44.130 --> 00:18:45.660
Jigen Bakudan?

00:18:45.660 --> 00:18:47.600
It's a time bomb monster!

00:18:47.600 --> 00:18:49.020
Yes.

00:18:49.330 --> 00:18:53.820
Jigen Bakudan is a bomb monster that cannot attack.

00:18:53.820 --> 00:19:00.580
In two turns, its effect will destroy all monsters on my field.

00:19:00.900 --> 00:19:07.820
In other words, Jigen Bakudan will destroy Relinquished in two turns.

00:19:08.020 --> 00:19:11.990
Along with your monsters, Yugi boy.

00:19:12.200 --> 00:19:15.690
Relinquished originally has 0 attack points.

00:19:16.400 --> 00:19:20.580
Even if it's destroyed, Pegasus won't lose any life points.

00:19:20.580 --> 00:19:25.160
But Relinquished took Dark Magician.

00:19:25.160 --> 00:19:29.380
If it's destroyed, I'll lose life points equal to its attack points.

00:19:29.680 --> 00:19:33.310
If I don't stop this tribute combo, I lose!

00:19:34.460 --> 00:19:38.780
Yugi boy, can you break this combo?

00:19:39.000 --> 00:19:42.720
This tribute combo will lead you to destruction.

00:19:43.020 --> 00:19:44.460
I only have two turns left.

00:19:44.930 --> 00:19:48.190
I don't have a card in my hand that will let me make a comeback.

00:19:48.620 --> 00:19:51.760
And Pegasus knows everything anyway.

00:19:53.460 --> 00:19:55.320
I can only draw a card.

00:19:55.870 --> 00:20:01.340
But Pegasus's Millennium Eye will let him see what card I've drawn.

00:20:01.640 --> 00:20:03.220
What can I do?

00:20:03.810 --> 00:20:09.780
As long as I can Mind Scan, there's nothing you can do.

00:20:10.040 --> 00:20:13.750
You lose.  It's game over.

00:20:25.020 --> 00:20:26.700
What can I do?

00:20:34.880 --> 00:20:40.440
Yugi is fighting alone and struggling in the Shadow Game.

00:20:40.440 --> 00:20:43.320
He can't do anything?  I hate that!

00:20:43.320 --> 00:20:47.240
Our hearts are connected in a bond of friendship.

00:20:47.240 --> 00:20:50.000
Our hearts must reach Yugi!

00:20:50.000 --> 00:20:53.020
Let that become Yugi's strength to defeat Pegasus!

00:20:53.020 --> 00:20:57.150
Next time on Yu-Gi-Oh!:
Union of Light and Dark
Black Chaos Descends

00:20:57.150 --> 00:20:58.710
Duel, standby!

00:21:03.980 --> 00:21:12.390
The flask glistens

00:21:13.430 --> 00:21:20.230
Wait for me in the science classroom

00:21:20.730 --> 00:21:29.210
If we put our cold hands together

00:21:29.910 --> 00:21:36.980
And rub them together, they become warm

00:21:38.690 --> 00:21:42.820
Shower of happiness

00:21:43.110 --> 00:21:46.930
I will shower you with it

00:21:47.260 --> 00:21:55.200
I will support you even when you feel lonely

00:21:55.400 --> 00:21:59.440
Shower of happiness

00:21:59.710 --> 00:22:03.570
You are not alone

00:22:03.940 --> 00:22:10.280
You're protected by a giant ring of friendship
